ASSEMBLY (all from the back)\P1. Display (4), tab first into the lug\Ppocket, PCB on the housing step.\P2. Button (8) into its wall hole.\P3. Midframe (2) with XIAO (5) and\Pmotor (6), key tabs in the 45/135 deg\Pchannels.\P4. Battery (9) between the
  3
 ribs; back\Pcover (3): tab end first, then the\Pdisc.\P5. USB plug (7): barb through the +X\Pslot, then into the USB-C pocket.\P6. Screen protector (10) on the clean,\Pdry front face.\POverall %%c42.2 x 54.4 x 18.24.\PSection fill: grey = purchased 
