NOTES\P1. The 3D model pet_case.step (source pet_case.step.py) is\Pthe master; undimensioned features per model.\P2. FDM, PETG, 0.4 nozzle, 0.12-0.16 layers, 3-4 walls, 30\P% infill.\P3. Angles are CCW from +X, seen from the front (display\Pside).\P4
  3
. Window %%c34.6 (0.4 lip over the glass edge) is centred\P0.335 below the body axis (toward USB-C).\P5. Key channels 2x 4 wide at 45 and 135 deg; pry notch 5\Pwide x 0.8 at 225 deg.\P6. USB plug anchor slot 3.4 x 1.4 + thumb recess (+X, old\Pswitch 
  1
opening); button hole 3.6 x 2.0 with %%c6.4 x 0.6\Pfinger dimple (-X); both on the X axis.
